entioned tony maguire spider-man andrew  garfield spider-man  kirsten dunce's mj are all going to be  coming together  in spider-man 3. and then of course we  know that the universe is going to kind  of blow up in multiverse of  madness and it looks like it's marvel's  plan to eventually have all of these  universes start to fuse  together which will eventually give us  secret  wars now in this event you combine every  single milestone that i mentioned before  the x-men the fantastic four the new  avengers team the young avengers team  even the villains get together as well  and not just the ones that exist in our  universe but the ones that exist in  other different universes  as well so you have multiple iron man  running around multiple captain america  thor multiple versions of the fantastic  four of the x-men and on  and on all of the villains team up  together and all of the heroes team up  together but  in the comics ultimately it would be dr  doom who would end up controlling the  battle world that's where we were  introduced to god emperor doom one of  the strongest and most powerful villains  to ever exist in the marvel universe and  these milestones are all going to lead  to this  one huge insanely major event  and it's definitely going to be an event  that could top avengers end game  especially with the x-men fantastic four  and all of these different versions of  characters combining into one movie  or two or three different movies it'll  definitely take two but who knows they  could even do three but this is marvel's  master plan these are the steps that  they're going to take to eventually get  to secret wars there's going to be a lot  that happens in between these events and  the handful of years that are to come  but this is the game plan so if you love  marvel and want to stay up to date on  all of this be sure to subscribe so you  don't miss out on anything  let me know your thoughts on all of  these different major events in the  comments down b